Superior separation: Homochiral MOF– polymer mixed matrix membranes (MMMs) are synthesized by incorporation of amino acid functionalized MIL-53- $N\mathsf{H}_{2}$ into the polyethersulfone (PES)
matrix. The homochiral MIL-53-NHamino acid-PES MMM exhibits excellent enantioselectivity towards racemic 1- phenylethanol with enantiomeric excess values up to $100\%$ .
